==Relegation play-offs==
[[Al Raed FC|Al-Raed]] who finished 12th faced [[Al Batin FC|Al-Batin]] who finished 3rd in the [[2015–16 Saudi First Division]] for a two-legged play-off. The winner on aggregate score would take part in the 2016–17 Saudi Professional League.<ref name="regulations"/> Al-Raed won 5–3 on aggregate and secured their place in the next season.<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.alriyadh.com/1506598|title=الرائد برباعية في مرمى الباطن يضمن بقاءه في دوري جميل|publisher=Al-Riyadh|language=ar|date=26 May 2016|access-date=28 May 2016}}</ref>

